{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05389","headline":"奉和圣制同二相已下羣臣乐游园宴 · 崔尚","name":"奉和圣制同二相已下羣臣乐游园宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春日照长安，皇恩宠庶官。\n合钱承罢宴，赐帛复追欢。\n供帐凭高列，城池入迥宽。\n花催相国醉，鸟和乐人弹。\n北阙云中见，南山树杪看。\n乐游宜缔赏，舞咏惜将阑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔尚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}